title: "Recommendation Health Audit"
authors:
  - family-names: Ravikumar
    given-names: Amulya
type: software
abstract: >-
  A reproducible descriptive audit of recommendation position and clicks in a
  bounded sample of RARD scholarly-article recommendation logs, with a proposed
  randomized rank-swap experiment and planning-only sample-size scenarios.
keywords:
  - product analytics
  - recommender systems
  - experimentation
  - position bias
